Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:35:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 34/34] ASP: size cheat options to fit so big cheat lists load
 (fba_v56)

Every cheat option was allocated for 512 addresses (~33KB). Red Earth's
cheat file has 3859 options, which asked for ~127MB and got the emulator
killed on the stick (256MB, ~130MB free). Shrink each option to the
addresses it uses as soon as the parser moves on: Red Earth now peaks at
~100MB instead of ~218MB.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JCu91LrG764XV67j6TkDrQ
---
 src/burner/conc.cpp | 56 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------
 1 file changed, 40 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/burner/conc.cpp b/src/burner/conc.cpp
index 1451884d6..e1a2b8fbd 100644
--- a/src/burner/conc.cpp
+++ b/src/burner/conc.cpp
@@ -1,6 +1,37 @@
 // Burner cheat-file loader
 #include "burner.h"
 #include "neocdlist.h"
+#include <stddef.h>
+
+// ASP: every cheat option is allocated with room for CHEAT_MAX_ADDRESS (512)
+// addresses, about 33KB each. Red Earth's cheat file has 3859 options, so it
+// asked for ~127MB and the stick (256MB, ~130MB free) was killed outright.
+// Each option is cut down to the addresses it actually uses as soon as the
+// parser moves on to the next one, so only one full-size option exists at a
+// time. Options are always freshly allocated, never reused, so nothing writes
+// a full sizeof(CheatOption) into a shrunk one.
+static CheatOption** pAspOpenOpt = NULL;
+
+static void AspOptShrink()
+{
+	if (pAspOpenOpt == NULL || *pAspOpenOpt == NULL) { pAspOpenOpt = NULL; return; }
+	CheatOption* o = *pAspOpenOpt;
+	INT32 k = 0;
+	while (k < CHEAT_MAX_ADDRESS && o->AddressInfo[k].nAddress) k++;
+	size_t nSize = offsetof(CheatOption, AddressInfo) + (k + 1) * sizeof(CheatAddressInfo);
+	CheatOption* r = (CheatOption*)realloc(o, nSize);
+	if (r) *pAspOpenOpt = r;
+	pAspOpenOpt = NULL;
+}
+
+static void AspOptAlloc(CheatOption** pp)
+{
+	AspOptShrink();
+	if (*pp) free(*pp);
+	*pp = (CheatOption*)malloc(sizeof(CheatOption));
+	if (*pp) memset(*pp, 0, sizeof(CheatOption));
+	pAspOpenOpt = pp;
+}
 
